==Trivia==
*[[Sakura Sonic (Uber Rare Cat)|Sakura Sonic]] and Miyu Karasama were the only Shintoutsukai to have no voice lines.
*Many of the Shintou weapons were named after famous Japanese swords or swordsmiths.
*The main Shikigami were based on the 12 Chinese zodiac animals (rat, ox, etc.)
